heir existence is sustained by the remnants of a twisted, semi-sentient decay. Within their decrepit forms, a murky ichor oozes incessantly, a grotesque manifestation of the unholy influence that has befallen them. These semi-living monstrosities shuffle through the desolate landscapes, their movements accompanied by a nauseating squelching sound. While their minds have been reduced to fragmented memories and impulses, the Oozing Carcasses still retain a flicker of their former loyalty, instinctively drawn to areas of concentrated decay where they gather in macabre communion.</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"webdesc-from\" style=\"float: right; margin: 0 2em 0 0;\">—Tibia Library</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"4312576280fe2ac417ea99da9a9e785b\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Oozing_Carcass_and_Sopping_Carcass_Artwork-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:152px;\"><img alt=\"Official Creature Artwork\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Official \" height=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Oozing_Carcass_and_Sopping_Carcass_Artwork_47504c.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"Oozing Carcass and Sopping Carcass Artwork.jpg (227 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Official Creature Artwork</div></div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-abilities\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Abilities\">Abilities</span></h3>\n<div class=\"ability_list\">Unknown.</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-creatu